Lets you compare the paths that gradient descent, conjugate gradient, BFGS and safeguarded Newton take on the same objective, to see how curvature information affects speed and stability. Choose an objective and an algorithm, click a starting point, and step or play through the iterations, optionally with a second algorithm overlaid as a dashed grey path.
